# Legacy runtime byproduct path: nothing writes here anymore (the review keeps the
# improvement text in its return value), but installs from older builds may still
# carry an `code_improvements/` folder. Keeping the ignore rule means those stale
# directories can never be committed by accident; it costs nothing at runtime.
/code_improvements/
